{% comment %}

SOOTHING SAUNAS — GLOBAL ROUNDED IMAGE OVERRIDE
Redirects any standard image render to your rounded image style.
Use this when you want consistent rounded corners and shadows
across all product, collection, or media images.

USE WITH:
  {% render 'my-roundedimageoverride', image: product.featured_image, alt: product.title %}

{% endcomment %}

{% assign img_obj = image %}
{% assign img_alt = alt | default: img_obj.alt | default: '' %}

{% if img_obj %}
  {% render 'my-roundedimage',
    image: img_obj,
    alt: img_alt,
    width: width,
    height: height,
    radius: radius,
    shadow: shadow,
    background: background,
    hover_scale: hover_scale,
    fit: fit
  %}
{% endif %}